# uncanny_xmen_le 0.98 - worked out by the app from the ports of The Beatles 1.29, Deadpool LE 1.14, Deadpool Pro 1.16, Godzilla Premium/LE 1.16, Godzilla Pro 1.15, Jaws LE 1.02, TMNT Pro 1.59.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 29 of its 33 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 8 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Upper shooter lane, Dr flipper tgt, Shot 0x10000000, Right outlane drain.
# program sha1 0d33470241a7143cfe7b9e39dbcdea83ba6a5b95, portgen revision 3, 7 reference port(s) of framework generation B.
# 2 shot(s) the app could not name are named after the switch that made them in the check.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): countdown.

